# A town house: a box, a hip roof, a door and two windows.
# Y is up, +Z is the way the creature faces, one world unit is one map tile.
# The lowest vertex sits on y = 0 and the model is centred on x = 0 and z = 0,
# so the game places it by its feet.
#
# Faces are wound so that (c - a) x (b - a) points out of the solid, which is
# what tools/obj2cpp.py bakes as the face normal. Get it backwards and the
# model still draws, it just goes flat ambient dark.
#
# Eyes are not modelled. They are two depth tested dots in the 2D layer, which
# is a pixel each instead of eight triangles.
#
# About 2.15 units tall on a 3.1 by 2.5 unit footprint, 24 triangles.
# The door faces -Z so a house dropped in unrotated faces the player
# walking north up a route. The walls have no top and no bottom: the
# roof overhangs them on every side and the floor is under the ground.
# Door and windows are two quads each rather than boxes, since their
# edges are inside the wall.

mtllib house.mtl

# walls, 8 triangles
v 1.550 1.500 1.250
v -1.550 1.500 1.250
v -1.550 1.500 -1.250
v 1.550 1.500 -1.250
v 1.550 0.000 1.250
v -1.550 0.000 1.250
v -1.550 0.000 -1.250
v 1.550 0.000 -1.250
usemtl house_wall
f 1 5 6 2
f 2 6 7 3
f 3 7 8 4
f 4 8 5 1

# roof, 4 triangles
v 0.000 2.150 0.000
v 1.800 1.460 1.500
v -1.800 1.460 1.500
v -1.800 1.460 -1.500
v 1.800 1.460 -1.500
usemtl house_roof
f 9 10 11
f 9 11 12
f 9 12 13
f 9 13 10

# door, 4 triangles
v 0.340 1.000 -1.250
v -0.340 1.000 -1.250
v -0.340 0.000 -1.250
v 0.340 0.000 -1.250
v 0.340 1.000 -1.290
v -0.340 1.000 -1.290
v -0.340 0.000 -1.290
v 0.340 0.000 -1.290
usemtl house_door
f 14 17 16 15
f 18 19 20 21

# window, 4 triangles
v 1.160 1.280 -1.250
v 0.680 1.280 -1.250
v 0.680 0.880 -1.250
v 1.160 0.880 -1.250
v 1.160 1.280 -1.290
v 0.680 1.280 -1.290
v 0.680 0.880 -1.290
v 1.160 0.880 -1.290
usemtl house_glass
f 22 25 24 23
f 26 27 28 29

# window, 4 triangles
v -0.680 1.280 -1.250
v -1.160 1.280 -1.250
v -1.160 0.880 -1.250
v -0.680 0.880 -1.250
v -0.680 1.280 -1.290
v -1.160 1.280 -1.290
v -1.160 0.880 -1.290
v -0.680 0.880 -1.290
usemtl house_glass
f 30 33 32 31
f 34 35 36 37
